{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5OrbitSum","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.cl3Zeta5_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.cl3Zeta5_pos","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.lean#L83-L89","doc":"**Provable content (sorry-free): the realised $2\\pi/5$ value is\nstrictly positive** — the geometric invariant cannot be the zero\ninvariant (witness non-degeneracy transported through the anchor). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.realize_pair_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.realize_pair_sum","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.lean#L73-L81","doc":"**Provable content (sorry-free): the realised PAIR satisfies the proved\norbit identity** $\\mathrm{Cl}_3(2\\pi/5) + \\mathrm{Cl}_3(4\\pi/5)\n= -(12/25)\\,\\zeta(3)$ — the corrected (factor-2-fixed) form, derived\nfrom the witness anchors + `BringTrilogDepth3Witness.pair_sum_eq`\n(which rests on the proved `Cl3Zeta5OrbitSum.orbit_sum_identity`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.cl3Zeta5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.cl3Zeta5","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.lean#L69-L71","doc":"The depth-3 Bring trilog $\\mathrm{Cl}_3(2\\pi/5) \\approx 0.18936791\\ldots$,\nas the realised value of the $2\\pi/5$ geometric invariant. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.realize_4pi5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.realize_4pi5","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.lean#L63-L63","doc":"**The witness anchor**: the $4\\pi/5$ invariant realises the witnessed\n$\\mathrm{Cl}_3(4\\pi/5)$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.realize_2pi5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.realize_2pi5","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.lean#L60-L60","doc":"**The witness anchor**: the $2\\pi/5$ invariant realises the witnessed\n$\\mathrm{Cl}_3(2\\pi/5)$ (not an arbitrary real). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.g_4pi5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.g_4pi5","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.lean#L57-L57","doc":"A geometric invariant realising $\\mathrm{Cl}_3(4\\pi/5)$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.g_2pi5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.g_2pi5","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.lean#L55-L55","doc":"A geometric invariant realising $\\mathrm{Cl}_3(2\\pi/5)$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.realize","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.realize","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.lean#L53-L53","doc":"Archimedean evaluation of a candidate invariant. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.GeomInvariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.GeomInvariant","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.lean#L51-L51","doc":"Candidate geometric/topological invariants (hyperbolic 4-manifold\nvolume, knot Chern–Simons, $\\overline{\\mathcal{M}}_{0,5}$ iterated\nintegral). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.mk","kind":"ctor","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.lean#L47-L47","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization","kind":"class","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Cl3Zeta5GeometricRealization.lean#L40-L63","doc":"**Geometric realisation of $\\mathrm{Cl}_3(2\\pi/5)$** — §3b DEPENDENT\nconjecture class (conditional on `BringTrilogDepth3Witness`),\nwitness-anchored: the candidate geometric invariants must realise the\nwitnessed archimedean components.\n\nConjectural class — see\n[`conj:cl3-zeta5-geometric-realization`](../../../quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/cl3-zeta5-geometric-realization.md). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:cl3-zeta5-geometric-realization","label":"conj:cl3-zeta5-geometric-realization","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/cl3-zeta5-geometric-realization.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}